    "flow_gAVTzH": {
      "type": "flow",
      "blocks": {
        "media_NayzzC": {
          "type": "media",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/pexels-rezendeluan-1093161.jpg",
            "show_sound_control": false,
            "video_url": "",
            "video_alt_text": "",
            "enable_video_autoplay": false,
            "subheading": "",
            "heading": "Measurement of Maximal Oxygen Uptake (VO2 Max)",
            "image_style_heading": "square",
            "image_ratio_heading": "aspect-16/9",
            "description": "<p>The Aiwo VO2 Max test directly measures the maximum amount of oxygen your body can utilize during intense exercise. This “maximal oxygen uptake” value is considered the gold standard for evaluating aerobic capacity, reflecting how efficiently your cardiovascular and respiratory systems deliver oxygen to working muscles at peak exertion.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_new_window_button": false,
            "show_button_style": "text-link"
          }
        },
        "media_4VUdUM": {
          "type": "media",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/pexels-rezendeluan-1093161.jpg",
            "show_sound_control": false,
            "video_url": "",
            "video_alt_text": "",
            "enable_video_autoplay": false,
            "subheading": "",
            "heading": "Cardiovascular Fitness Assessment",
            "image_style_heading": "square",
            "image_ratio_heading": "aspect-16/9",
            "description": "<p>By assessing your VO2 Max, the Aiwo test provides a comprehensive evaluation of cardiovascular health and fitness. It indicates how well your heart, lungs, and blood vessels work together to deliver oxygen throughout your body during exercise. Higher VO2 Max scores generally correlate with stronger cardiovascular function and better long-term heart health.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_new_window_button": false,
            "show_button_style": "text-link"
          }
        },
        "media_mHeMkm": {
          "type": "media",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/pexels-rezendeluan-1093161.jpg",
            "show_sound_control": false,
            "video_url": "",
            "video_alt_text": "",
            "enable_video_autoplay": false,
            "subheading": "",
            "heading": "Endurance Level Evaluation",
            "image_style_heading": "square",
            "image_ratio_heading": "aspect-16/9",
            "description": "<p>The results of Aiwo’s VO2 Max test help determine your endurance level, as individuals with higher VO2 Max can sustain more intense physical activity for a longer time. This is crucial for athletes and anyone seeking to monitor and improve their stamina or track progress in endurance-based training programs.</p>",
            "button_text": "18 Tests",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_new_window_button": false,
            "show_button_style": "text-link"
          }
        },
        "media_GKndj4": {
          "type": "media",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/pexels-rezendeluan-1093161.jpg",
            "show_sound_control": false,
            "video_url": "",
            "video_alt_text": "",
            "enable_video_autoplay": false,
            "subheading": "",
            "heading": "Personalised Exercise Recommendations",
            "image_style_heading": "square",
            "image_ratio_heading": "aspect-16/9",
            "description": "<p>After your test, Aiwo interprets your VO2 Max results and uses them to tailor customized training or exercise recommendations. This ensures your fitness plan is based on your individual aerobic capacity and current health status, making your workouts more effective for improving endurance, cardiovascular health, and overall fitness.</p>",
            "button_text": "31 Tests",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_new_window_button": false,
            "show_button_style": "text-link"
          }
        }
      },
